{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "workbook": {
    "sheets": [
      "S"
    ],
    "cells": [
      {
        "cell": "S!A1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "key"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "missing IF result publishes zero through a cell reference",
      "evidence": [
        "Excel worksheet publication contract confirmed by the user's native Excel observation: an empty reference stored as a formula becomes numeric zero. The user explicitly authorized applying the same publication rule to IF's empty result, while preserving blank inside expressions. This supersedes the earlier project-only blank publication contract; no new native Excel execution is claimed."
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!A1",
          "content": {
            "formula": "IF(TRUE,,)"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "content": {
            "formula": "ISBLANK(A1)"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!A1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0.0
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!A1",
          "content": {
            "type": "blank"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "blank lookup reaches consumer before numeric coercion",
      "evidence": [
        "Research reproduction independently evaluated with Apache POI 5.4.1: MIN(HLOOKUP(\"key\",A1:A2,2,FALSE),0.03) returns 0.03 with A1=\"key\" and A2 absent. Local coercion contract preserves the selected blank until its consumer. Not a native Excel observation."
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "content": {
            "formula": "MIN(HLOOKUP(\"key\",A1:A2,2,FALSE),0.03)"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!B2",
          "content": {
            "formula": "ISBLANK(HLOOKUP(\"key\",A1:A2,2,FALSE))"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0.03
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B2",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!A2",
          "content": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0.05
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0.03
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B2",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!A2",
          "content": {
            "type": "blank"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0.03
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B2",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "inline missing IF result remains blank",
      "evidence": [
        "https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML/blob/09f2f21a60e821ce7fb18ca3576b272e5dd6d921/ClosedXML.Tests/Excel/CalcEngine/InformationTests.cs: IsBlank_InlineBlank_True"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "set",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "content": {
            "formula": "ISBLANK(IF(TRUE,,))"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "check",
          "cell": "S!B1",
          "expected": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
